^{:go/end 39} (go/func InitAddrOffset "InitAddrOffset writes the static name symbol lsym to n, it does not modify n.\nIt's the caller responsibility to make sure lsym is from ONAME/PEXTERN node.\n" [^{:tag (* ir/Name)} n ^int64 noff ^{:tag (* obj/LSym)} lsym ^int64 off]
