^{:go/end 53} (go/func InitSlice "InitSlice writes a static slice symbol {lsym, lencap, lencap} to n+noff, it does not modify n.\nIt's the caller responsibility to make sure lsym is from ONAME node.\n" [^{:tag (* ir/Name)} n ^int64 noff ^{:tag (* obj/LSym)} lsym ^int64 lencap]
